{"id":"3e07004160abc932","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-set-p.md","title":"PER completion of a tripos","display":"df-set-p — PER completion of a tripos","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-df-set-p","aliases":["16-df-set-p","Tripos-to-topos category Set(p)"],"display":"df-set-p — PER completion of a tripos","depends_on":["[[16-df-tripos]]","[[16-df-set-of-fibration]]","[[16-df-split-higher-order-fibration]]"],"source":"Definition6.1.1 pp.374–376 (PDF394–396); canonical local construction in set-of-fibration","revision_date":"2026-10-20"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-set-p"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-set-p</span><span>Tripos-to-topos category Set(p)</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-set-p — PER completion of a tripos"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0632c91c845f3662\" href=\"?note=0632c91c845f3662\" title=\"16-df-tripos\">16-df-tripos</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"58e47ffb16d63410\" href=\"?note=58e47ffb16d63410\" title=\"16-df-set-of-fibration\">16-df-set-of-fibration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"eeefa02192bbb359\" href=\"?note=eeefa02192bbb359\" title=\"16-df-split-higher-order-fibration\">16-df-split-higher-order-fibration</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition6.1.1 pp.374–376 (PDF394–396); canonical local construction in set-of-fibration"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-20"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal P\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\">\\(p:\\mathcal P\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tripos}(p)\\lor\\mathrm{SplitTripos}(p)\">\\(\\mathrm{Tripos}(p)\\lor\\mathrm{SplitTripos}(p)\\)</span>，分别采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0632c91c845f3662\" href=\"?note=0632c91c845f3662\" title=\"16-df-tripos\">16-df-tripos</a> 与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"eeefa02192bbb359\" href=\"?note=eeefa02192bbb359\" title=\"16-df-split-higher-order-fibration\">16-df-split-higher-order-fibration</a>。两种结构均蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegFib}(p)\">\\(\\mathrm{RegFib}(p)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Set}(p)\">\\(\\mathbf{Set}(p)\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"58e47ffb16d63410\" href=\"?note=58e47ffb16d63410\" title=\"16-df-set-of-fibration\">16-df-set-of-fibration</a> 的同一完整关系商范畴构造。</li>\n<li>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\">\\(I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in\\mathcal P_{I\\times I}\">\\(\\rho\\in\\mathcal P_{I\\times I}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathcal P_{J\\times J}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathcal P_{J\\times J}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi\\in\\mathcal P_{I\\times J}\">\\(\\phi\\in\\mathcal P_{I\\times J}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PER}_p(I,\\rho)\">\\(\\mathrm{PER}_p(I,\\rho)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FuncRel}_p((I,\\rho),(J,\\sigma);\\phi)\">\\(\\mathrm{FuncRel}_p((I,\\rho),(J,\\sigma);\\phi)\\)</span> 采用规范页；本页的mathsf拼写为固定这些源靶后的兼容记号。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{PER}_p(\\rho)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{PER}_p(I,\\rho),\\\\\n\\mathsf{FuncRel}_p(\\phi;\\rho,\\sigma)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FuncRel}_p((I,\\rho),(J,\\sigma);\\phi).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{PER}_p(\\rho)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{PER}_p(I,\\rho),\\\\\n\\mathsf{FuncRel}_p(\\phi;\\rho,\\sigma)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FuncRel}_p((I,\\rho),(J,\\sigma);\\phi).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>规范构造用纤维重索引、存在量词和源靶标签正式给出对称/传递、功能关系、等价商、恒等与复合。本页不再把任意基范畴对象当作集合逐元素取值；对Sets基底，可在具体谓词表示下读为原书关系式。所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,J\">\\(I,J\\)</span> 参数在使用两个简记时保持固定，不能由积对象的集合编码猜测因子。</p>\n<p>来源 Definition6.1.1 pp.374–376 (PDF394–396)。这里只保留一个规范Set(p)构造；Eff引用同一构造，避免两份关系复合与箭头编码漂移。</p>\n<p>普通与分裂入口使用不同的泛对象条件，但均具备此处 PER 商构造所需的正则纤维结构。加入分裂入口是为了接纳已经给出的实现性模型，不改动对象、功能关系、等价商或复合的定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-tripos","status":"resolved","id":"0632c91c845f3662","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-tripos]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-set-of-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"58e47ffb16d63410","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-set-of-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-split-higher-order-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"eeefa02192bbb359","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-split-higher-order-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-tripos","status":"resolved","id":"0632c91c845f3662","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal P\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}$ 满足 $\\mathrm{Tripos}(p)\\lor\\mathrm{SplitTripos}(p)$，分别采用 [[16-df-tripos]] 与 [[16-df-split-higher-order-fibration]]。两种结构均蕴含 $\\mathrm{RegFib}(p)$；$\\mathbf{Set}(p)$ 使用 [[16-df-set-of-fibration]] 的同一完整关系商范畴构造。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-split-higher-order-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"eeefa02192bbb359","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal P\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}$ 满足 $\\mathrm{Tripos}(p)\\lor\\mathrm{SplitTripos}(p)$，分别采用 [[16-df-tripos]] 与 [[16-df-split-higher-order-fibration]]。两种结构均蕴含 $\\mathrm{RegFib}(p)$；$\\mathbf{Set}(p)$ 使用 [[16-df-set-of-fibration]] 的同一完整关系商范畴构造。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-set-of-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"58e47ffb16d63410","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal P\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}$ 满足 $\\mathrm{Tripos}(p)\\lor\\mathrm{SplitTripos}(p)$，分别采用 [[16-df-tripos]] 与 [[16-df-split-higher-order-fibration]]。两种结构均蕴含 $\\mathrm{RegFib}(p)$；$\\mathbf{Set}(p)$ 使用 [[16-df-set-of-fibration]] 的同一完整关系商范畴构造。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"p:\\mathcal P\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Tripos}(p)\\lor\\mathrm{SplitTripos}(p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RegFib}(p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{Set}(p)","display":false},{"tex":"I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho\\in\\mathcal P_{I\\times I}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma\\in\\mathcal P_{J\\times J}","display":false},{"tex":"\\phi\\in\\mathcal P_{I\\times J}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PER}_p(I,\\rho)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FuncRel}_p((I,\\rho),(J,\\sigma);\\phi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{PER}_p(\\rho)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{PER}_p(I,\\rho),\\\\\n\\mathsf{FuncRel}_p(\\phi;\\rho,\\sigma)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FuncRel}_p((I,\\rho),(J,\\sigma);\\phi).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"I,J","display":false}],"bytes":2201,"backlinks":[{"id":"d3801cd1b9bf1589","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":4,"excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal P\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}$ 为 [[16-df-set-p]] 使用的同一 tripos。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-325","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-set-p|df-set-p — PER completion of a tripos]]"},{"id":"55e5037ed821c800","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"结论依赖 [[16-df-set-p]] 的 PER 构造；若把 $\\mathbf{Set}(p)$ 误解为离散对象子范畴，该定理一般不成立。"}],"outgoing":["0632c91c845f3662","58e47ffb16d63410","eeefa02192bbb359"]}